   the portions in which the rights holder holds rights.

7. Authorized work.
   This document does not restrict development or maintenance of this repository by
   the rights holder or by collaborators the rights holder has authorized.

8. Enforcement.
   Any use in breach of this document is copyright infringement. The rights holder
   will pursue civil and criminal remedies under the Copyright Act of the Republic
   of Korea and other applicable laws, including injunctions, damages and criminal
   complaints.

9. Permission requests.
   Permission may be granted only in writing by the rights holder.
   Contact: https://github.com/brownrigoon-commits

